WEBVTT

00:00.754 --> 00:02.903
main apni lachak ko thora bohot behtar bananay kay mood main hoon

00:02.903 --> 00:06.433
is liay maiany socha kay yoga ki classes mai dakhla loon

00:06.433 --> 00:10.172
to main maqami yoga ki jaga per gaya jis ka naam tha SUPER YOGA

00:10.172 --> 00:12.701
aur un say poocha , "Is per kitni lagat ayay gee?"

00:12.701 --> 00:15.737
aur unhon nay kaha, " hamaray paas aik BASIC aur

00:15.737 --> 00:17.675
aik TRIAL PLAN hay"

00:17.675 --> 00:19.368
ager aap cheezon ko TRY kerna chahtay hain to us kay liay TRIAL PLAN

00:19.368 --> 00:21.231
aap kisi bhi SESSION main shamil ho jayein

00:21.231 --> 00:24.822
is per fe ghanta $12 ki lagat ayay gee

00:24.822 --> 00:27.035
lekin ager aap ko acha lagta hay jo bhi aap yahan kertay hain

00:27.035 --> 00:29.075
tab aap ko mahana rukniyat laini parhay gee

00:29.075 --> 00:30.362
us kay huay fe mahina $20,

00:30.362 --> 00:32.452
us ko aap BASIC PLAN ki surat daikh saktay hain

00:32.452 --> 00:35.420
ye mahana huay $20 aur phir is per katoti bhi

00:35.420 --> 00:37.569
ye huay sirf fe SESSION $8

00:37.569 --> 00:41.590
ye dilshasp hay magaer main thora pareshan hoon

00:41.590 --> 00:44.084
kon sa PLAN mujhe lena chahiyay?

00:44.084 --> 00:47.570
is liay sab say pehlay, mujhe ye sochna chahiyay kay

00:47.570 --> 00:48.956
mujhe kitni raqam ada kerni parhay gee

00:48.956 --> 00:52.390
aur wo munhasir hay kay main darhaqeeqat kitnay sessions main shirkat kerta hoon

00:52.420 --> 00:54.101
aur shuru kay andazay kay liay

00:54.101 --> 00:56.282
sab say pehlay to kuch VARIABLES ki tareef ker laini chahiyay

00:56.282 --> 01:01.763
ager SESSIONS ki tadad "S" ho jin main her mahinay main shirkat karoon,

01:01.763 --> 01:07.741
aur wo SESSIONS jin main her mahinay mian hazri doon

01:07.741 --> 01:09.941
mainay faisla kia kay SUPER YOGA per hoon

01:09.941 --> 01:15.155
aur ager C = "kul mahana raqam" to.....

01:15.616 --> 01:18.549
meri kul mahana raqam

01:18.933 --> 01:20.941
to in VARIABLES ko isterhan mutarif kernay kay baad

01:20.941 --> 01:22.849
sochtay hain kay main kitna kharcha karoon ga

01:22.849 --> 01:24.141
her aik PLAN kay mutabiq

01:24.141 --> 01:26.527
aur saath hi ye sochtay huay kay main kitnay SESSIONS main shareek hoon ga

01:26.527 --> 01:29.605
to sab say pehlay, ham laitay hain TRIAL PLAN

01:29.605 --> 01:31.147
kionkay wo thora aasaan lagta hay

01:31.147 --> 01:32.755
aur main aik COLUMN yahan banata hoon

01:32.755 --> 01:38.768
meri paas raqam hay, asal main, main SESSIONS ki tadad yahan dikhata hoon

01:39.807 --> 01:44.243
ye hui SESSIONS ki tadad aur phir meray paas hay qeemat

01:44.243 --> 01:47.135
aur phir main aik chota say TABLE yahan banata hoon

01:47.135 --> 01:50.048
chota TABLE, ye hoga meray TRIAL PLAN kay liay

01:50.048 --> 01:51.570
aur phir yehi kaam kertay hain,

01:51.570 --> 01:53.093
kionkay ham TRIAL PLAN kay liay ye ker rahay hain

01:53.093 --> 01:55.507
BASIC PLAN kay liay bhi bana laintay hain, ta kay ham mawaazna ker sakain

01:55.845 --> 01:57.884
ye ho gaya BASIC PLAN kay liay

01:57.884 --> 01:59.923
to meray paas hay kul SESSIONS ki tadad

01:59.923 --> 02:03.768
aur meri kul raqam

02:04.521 --> 02:08.887
to chalain is kay baray main sochtay hain kay ager main kissi bhi sessions main shareek na hoon

02:08.887 --> 02:12.744
ager main kissi bhi sessions main shareek na honay ka faisal ker looon to...

02:12.744 --> 02:15.567
meray TRIAL PLAN kay muaboq, meri laagat kia ho gee?

02:16.905 --> 02:20.833
kheir, $12 per SESSION, 12 x no session

02:20.833 --> 02:22.369
kheir, mujhe kuch ada nahi kerna parhay ga

02:22.369 --> 02:25.898
Meri lagat ho gee sifar

02:25.898 --> 02:28.036
ab yehi sawal kia jayay

02:28.036 --> 02:29.091
BASIC PLAN mian to..

02:29.091 --> 02:33.102
ager meray paas BASIC PLAN hay, lekin aik mahinay main

02:33.102 --> 02:35.485
main kissi bhi SESSIONS main hazir na hoon

02:35.485 --> 02:38.036
main GYM nahi jaata, main bilkul bhi GYM na jaoon..

02:38.036 --> 02:40.100
Mijhe kitni raqam ada kerni parhay gee?

02:40.946 --> 02:42.615
kheir, $8 fe SESSION kay hisaab say..

02:42.615 --> 02:44.230
mujhe kissi SESSION main janay ki zaroorat nahi

02:44.230 --> 02:45.562
to mujhe kuch bhi raqam ada kernay ki zaroorat nahi

02:45.562 --> 02:46.894
fe SESSION ki bunyad per

02:46.894 --> 02:49.418
magar mujhe $20 fe mahina ada kerna parhay ga

02:49.418 --> 02:53.239
to mujhe $20 ada kernay parhain gaay

02:53.239 --> 02:55.076
ye aur baat kay main gaya bhi na hoon..

02:55.691 --> 02:57.923
Ye itni achi soorat haal nahi nazar aati

02:57.923 --> 03:00.365
lekin ham aur khakon ka bhi jaiza laitay hian..

03:00.365 --> 03:04.286
zara is khakay ko zehen main layay jahan main ! SESSION main hazri daita hoon

03:05.024 --> 03:07.249
jahan main 1 SESSION main shirkat kerta hoon..

03:07.249 --> 03:11.011
TRIAL PLAN kay mutabiq mujhe kitna ada kerna parhay ga?

03:11.380 --> 03:15.741
kheir, $12 fe SESSION x 1 SESSION

03:15.741 --> 03:21.561
mujhe $12 ada kernay parhay gaay

03:21.637 --> 03:24.476
ab ussi khakay ko BASIC PLAN kay mutabiq sochiay

03:24.476 --> 03:27.011
BASIC PLAN kay mtabiq, ager main 1 SESSION main hazir hota hoon

03:27.011 --> 03:32.070
kheir, ye huay $8 fe SESSION x 1 SESSION

03:32.070 --> 03:33.173
is kay liay huay $8

03:33.173 --> 03:35.257
jama sirf bunyadi mahana ujrat..

03:35.257 --> 03:37.967
to main sirf $20 + ($8 x 1) ada karoon ga

03:37.967 --> 03:39.209
ye huay $28

03:39.209 --> 03:43.981
mujhe $28 ada kernay parhain gaay

03:43.981 --> 03:46.703
to TRIAL PLAN phir bhi munasib lagta hay

03:46.703 --> 03:49.392
chahay main 1 SESSION main bhi shreek ho jaoon ..

03:49.392 --> 03:50.303
is ko wazay ker laitay hain

03:50.303 --> 03:51.303
ye raqam DOLLARS main hay

03:51.303 --> 03:53.506
aur ye yahan $28 hay

03:53.506 --> 03:54.560
aur main yun hi kerta rahoon ga

03:54.560 --> 03:55.615
aur mian aap ki bhi aisa kernay main hosla afzai karoon ga

03:55.615 --> 03:56.902
lekin 1 aur dafa hisaab laga laitay hain

03:56.902 --> 03:59.433
sirf daikhnay kay liay, sirf is addad ko zehen nasheen kernay kay liay

03:59.433 --> 04:02.989
ager main TRIAL PLAN kay mutabiq 2 SESSIONS main shareek hota hoon

04:02.989 --> 04:05.589
main kitni rqam ada karoon ga?

04:05.589 --> 04:08.368
kheir. ye huay $12 fe SESSION x 2 SEESIONS

04:08.368 --> 04:13.595
mujhe $24 ada kernay parhain gaay
